WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.750
Set up a strong video interview. Prepare the technology, framing, and backup plan so your conversation stays clear and calm.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.500
Tech check. Test the full route. Check the meeting link, camera, microphone, headphones, power, and internet connection.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Framing. Keep the camera at eye level. Use steady front lighting and a simple background with your face clearly visible.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.000
Presence. Look up when it matters. Watch the screen while listening, then return to the camera for key points.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.750
Backup. Prepare for interruptions. Keep the dial-in number, charger, notes, and interviewer contact details nearby.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.500
Before joining. Reset, then enter. Close extra apps, silence alerts, take one breath, and join a few minutes early.
